---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us — UniqueDigit" description="Learn more about UniqueDigit's data-grounded editorial testing and technology intelligence.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-ink mb-4">About UniqueDigit</h1>
    <p class="text-base text-muted leading-relaxed mb-8">
      UniqueDigit is an independent digital media publication and intelligence platform founded to deliver authentic, data-driven hardware reviews, real-time bullion indexes, and AI directory comparisons for Indian consumers.
    </p>

    <div class="prose max-w-none text-ink">
      <h2>Our Editorial Principles</h2>
      <p>
        In an era of generic AI fluff, UniqueDigit adheres strictly to <strong>grounded facts</strong>. We cross-reference hardware benchmarks, official bureau standards (such as BIS HUID for gold), and real Indian retail pricing.
      </p>

      <h2>Zero Fake Metrics Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We do not display simulated view counts, fake doctor endorsements, or misleading rating statistics. What you see on UniqueDigit is driven by real Google Trends and audited databases.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact Editorial Desk</h2>
      <p>
        For inquiries, corrections, or hardware review submissions, reach out to our team at <a href="mailto:editorial@uniquedigit.in" class="text-brand font-bold underline">editorial@uniquedigit.in</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
